# 予定表 (design 11.10, 11.2.6), for tools/ui_run.py: the 仮身操作, 実身操作
# and 実行 of a link of the month, done by the shared part of lib/libtv
# (tv_vop.c). A link of 仮身サンプル is dropped on 2026/10, its 属性変更,
# 続柄設定, 実身複製, 新版作成, 起動アプリの固定 (the menu then offering
# 起動アプリを最新にする) and 実行's list are done, and the link and the two
# links to the copies, taken together, are carried out of the window at once.
# The pictures are checked against the ones recorded when the program did
# these itself, before they were moved to lib/libtv.
